hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"285","\I asked 'A’isha (may Allah be well pleased with her) about the ritual prayer of Allah’s Messenger (Allah bless him and give him peace)"," and she said: 'He used to perform two cycles of ritual prayer before the noon prayer and two cycles after it"," two cycles after the\nsunset prayer"," two cycles after the evening prayer"," and two before the dawn prayer.’”"""
